[[0,2033251,0,2,0,2,"2017-08-01T23:52:55","rspix000","",[],"","School can't afford supplies, so teacher panhandles for money. She's stunned by the response","http://shareably.co/teacher-panhandles-for-classroom-supplies/","news"],[1,10029530,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-02T00:09:52","Thereunto","",[],"<p>I'm actually surprised there wasn't a twist like her being arrested or politicians crying for a piece of the money she collected.</p>"],[1,10029936,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-02T01:02:50","meltingpotofhambone","",[],"<p>Well when we import useless sand niggers the funding for education tanks and more obama phones and ebts are given.</p>"],[1,10030453,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-02T02:06:24","by2inthemorning","[e]",[],"<p>Fifth Grade:\n1 #2 Pencils, sharpened, 12‐cnt pack\n1 Crayons, 24 count\n1 Full‐length colored pencils, pre‐sharpened, 12 count\n1 Pens, medium point, red\n1 Dry Erase Markers, set of 4 low odor black\n1 Scissors, pointed, 7”\n1 Pencil box\n1 Manual pencil sharpener\n1 Set of earbuds or headphones\n1 Roll of paper towels\n1 Kleenex facial tissue, at least 125\n1 Glue sticks, large, washable, white\n1 Composition book\n1 Wipes, Lysol/Clorox disinfecting\n1 Glue, liquid\n1 3-Ring Binder, 1”\n1 Computer mouse\n3 Spiral Notebooks (70 page)\n4 2-Pocket Folders (w/3-prong fasteners) Red, Blue, Green and Yellow</p>\n<p>Thats quite a bit . In 5th grade we had pencils and 5 notebooks. That isnt the real issue though , the chromebooks and tablets the schools are /were using ? Is that program stil being used? idk anyways werent saving anybody any money, it didn't improve learning and cost schools money .Lets also not forget now I dont know about other states but I remember Ohio when Kasich spent <a href=\"http://dailycaller.com/2015/07/01/ohio-dumps-common-core-test-but-keeps-core/\">25 million on a fucking test</a> just to go around and spend another 20 million <a href=\"http://www.cleveland.com/metro/index.ssf/2015/07/ohio_will_pay_236_million_to_air_for_common_core_tests_next_year.html\">on another common core test !!!</a> see they want you to feel bad and oh support this and that when the money is there it's just being severly misspent.</p>"],[2,10030830,10030453,1,0,1,"2017-08-02T03:01:08","rspix000","[e]",[],"<p>Very thoughtful. thanks for your time. I remember a internet-famous pic of students in Pakistan studying intently while sitting in a hovel on dirt. It may not always be &quot;things&quot; that education need, but quality teachers. How do you attract those without substantial resources? Let's ask the hedge fund boys who make the argument that their &quot;bonesus&quot; which are larger than all the combined US kindergarten teacher's salaries, are supported by supposed need to &quot;retain the talent&quot;. Oh and I wish the MIC had to panhandle and our teachers/students got the $Trillion a year military budget, just so you know that my eye is on a larger prize.</p>"],[3,10030949,10030830,0,0,0,"2017-08-02T03:18:20","by2inthemorning","",[],"<p>Now I don't agree with you that the military needs to panhandle and that teachers need to be given millions of dollars.They have benefits and paychecks which is something that a lot of americans do not have right now, but they need to learn how to fight or ask questions .They need to follow the money and quit voting one way just because their union bought a certain politician and lay off the sob stories to their communities.</p>"]]
[[0,2033252,0,3,0,3,"2017-08-01T23:52:57","harry_nash","",[],"","Facebook pulls plug on language-inventing chatbots? THE TRUTH","https://www.theregister.co.uk/2017/08/01/facebook_chatbots_did_not_invent_new_language/","whatever"],[1,10029441,0,1,0,1,"2017-08-01T23:59:28","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/f1DXB\">https://archive.is/f1DXB</a> | : \n</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Facebook pulls plug on language-inventing chatbots? THE TRUTH • The Register </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>'Alice: balls have a ball to me to me to me to me to me to me to me Bob: i . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ' </p>\n<p>'Alice: balls have zero to me to me to me to me to me to me to me to me to Bob: you i everything else . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ' </p>\n<p>'Alice: balls have a ball to me to me to me to me to me to me to me Bob: i i can i i i everything else . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ' </p>\n<p>'Several publications called the programs “creepy.” Some journalists implied Facebook yanked the plug before, presumably, some kind of super-intelligence reared its head. ' </p>\n<p>'On Monday, excitement levels among hacks hit the roof as fevered amid claims Facebook had scrambled to shut down its chatbots after they started inventing their own language. ' </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/vyRk2u.png\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,10030047,0,2,0,2,"2017-08-02T01:18:27","dooob","",[],"<p>What a clickbait, it is an AI for Christ's sake. Artificial intelligence cant become self aware because it follows mathematical ways of choosing what to say.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Zachary Lipton, an incoming assistant professor of machine learning at Carnegie Mellon University in the US, told The Register this week: “The work is interesting. But these are just statistical models, the same as those that Google uses to play board games or that your phone uses to make predictions about what word you’re saying in order to transcribe your messages. They are no more sentient than a bowl of noodles, or your shoes.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>And how is this a new language?</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Bob: i can i i everything else . . . . . . . . . . . . . . </p>\n<p>Alice: balls have zero to me to me to me to me to me to me to me to me to </p>\n<p>Bob: you i everything else . . . . . . . . . . . . . . </p>\n<p>Alice: balls have a ball to me to me to me to me to me to me to me </p>\n<p>Bob: i i can i i i everything else . . . . . . . . . . . . . . </p>\n<p>Alice: balls have a ball to me to me to me to me to me to me to me </p>\n<p>Bob: i . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . </p>\n<p>Alice: balls have zero to me to me to me to me to me to me to me to me to </p>\n</blockquote>"],[1,10030573,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-02T02:24:54","10030573","[A]",[],"<p>Pulls plug = hides in basement </p>"]]
